          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On September 30, 1978, around 11:30 PM, two walkers observed the passage of a flying object flying very low, which intrigued them. The object was round in shape, with a bright container and red and yellow lights. No noise was heard during the object's rotations above a railroad bridge. No other testimony was collected to corroborate this observation, for which we lack information.",
